UFACTURE OR FULL-CURRENT TEST" (at 20 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top)) (uuid 18eb7cf7-17a0-5976-beb0-629b5d1aa210)) (text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid cd71858b-5734-5683-a340-7b7463be14c8)) (text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9228eb06-c948-58c9-a758-48787e91bd4d)) (text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid e109468c-dbbd-5ab6-b18d-a320a9d4604c)) (text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7cedbb71-0893-52b9-9a2a-d801d47086b3)) (text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid f3641e79-402b-5a3a-bde1-34097714e12d)) (text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 031e37ca-6b80-501e-bb99-77c22e602b37)))